  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Turkey. The main outcome areas it contributes to are advancing equality and workers rights, building new alliances and pushing progressive politics. The main rights holders are workers, blue collar, especially youth and women. Through the promotion of workers rights in Turkey, capacity building, research and analysis and local as well as international lobbying, cooperation with other Turkish union federations, ILO and Turkish CSO consortiums and human rights organisations the project aims to increase the POs members capacities in workers rights, work safety, gender equality, violence and harassment against women, legal protection, communication, human relations and social media, collective bargaining policies, labour law, organising and achieve progressive development within the outcome area.</narrative>
  </description>
